  "notes": "GAAP audit. The trim has no Statement of Activities (governmental_net_position has only the ending net position from the Statement of Net Position p1; beginning/change not in the trim). Governmental lines from the governmental funds statement (p3, Total Governmental Funds); its Taxes line is split: the Municipal Building debt service fund's 31,474 is printed 'Property taxes' on its budget schedule (p10); the remaining 657,966 has no printed tax type and stays taxes. Fund balances 1,452,916 / 1,587,831 (p3); ending_cash = governmental funds balance sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' 1,114,840 (p2), ending_investments = Certificate of Deposit 328,683 (p2); cash held by county treasurer 13,997 is a separate line, not added. Business-type from the proprietary Statement of Revenues, Expenses and Changes in Fund Net Position (p5, Totals: Rescue Squad, Water, Sewer, Solid Waste, Care Center); no single printed total, so receipts/disbursements totals are operating + nonoperating sums; the Totals cell for Interest Expense is hard to read and recorded as 105,628 (column cells 1,265 + 85,319 + 19,044; ties to total nonoperating 323,472 and net loss 337,251). Roll-forward 6,849,866 + 6,830,837 - 7,168,088 = 6,512,615. Proprietary cash flows from p6 Total column. Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1), Governmental and Business-type columns, totals from the Total column. Detail: General Fund from the combining statement by department (p12; more detailed than the General Fund budget schedule p7-p8, which is not recorded); Street Fund from its budget schedule (p9, budgetary basis); Municipal Building debt service fund from p10 (Prairie Hills St. District column has no activity); nonmajor funds per fund column from the combining statement (p11). The General Fund Transfer In 5,500 has no matching transfer out anywhere (decision_needed). Read pages 1-12 of 12."
